      "name": "Gnash",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The beheaded's previous action was a jaws Strike that dealt damage to its target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The severed head makes a second jaws Strike as it violently shakes itself, trying to rip away a mouthful of flesh. On a success, the target takes an additional <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> slashing damage and 1 persistent bleed damage.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
