  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>The most common beheaded appears simply as a rotting head, barely preserved by the magic that created it.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Beheaded are the reanimated heads of decapitation victims. These mindless undead fly through the air or roll around to attack their prey.</p>",
